      "message": "minor nit: this should follow git commit message \"style\". This page explains them quite well : https://chris.beams.io/posts/git-commit/\n\nThe TL;DR is that you need a 50-80 char commit summary, followed by a blank line, followed by a detailed commit message paragraph wrapped to 80 chars.\n\nE.g\n\n\"\"\"\nSet minSdk explicitly in AndroidManifest.xml\n\nThis is to allow merging....\n\nTest: ..\nBug: ..\nChange-Id: ..\n\"\"\"",
